# Repository Configuration Error

## What is the error?

The alias `{{ alias }}` has the same name as a command.  A comment that names a command always runs the command, so the alias `{{ alias }}` can never run.

## What to do?

Rename the alias in the `parameters.aliases` section of the `.terrateam/config.yml` file, then commit the change.

See the [documentation](https://stategraph.com/docs/reference/orchestration/configuration/parameters) for the parameters configuration.
